{
  "name": "Shocker (OpenShock + PiShock)",
  "id": "openshock",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "author": "community",
  "description": "Control OpenShock and PiShock devices from OSC-DreamChatbox. Status + last action in the chatbox. OpenShock can also show live actions triggered by others (who + type + intensity + duration).",
  "about": {
    "format": "markdown",
    "text": [
      "## Shocker plugin (OpenShock + PiShock)",
      "",
      "One plugin, two backends. Switch with the **Backend** setting.",
      "",
      "### OpenShock",
      "1. Create an API token on [openshock.app](https://openshock.app) → Settings → API Tokens.",
      "2. Paste it into **OpenShock API Token**.",
      "3. Press **Refresh**. Pick a shocker (or paste a UUID).",
      "4. Optional: enable **Watch live logs** to show actions done on the website / by others.",
      "",
      "### PiShock",
      "1. Username + API key from [pishock.com/#/account](https://pishock.com/#/account).",
      "2. Share code from the control page (Share button).",
      "3. Use the action buttons.",
      "",
      "### Placeholders",
      "- `{openshock}` – short status line",
      "- `{openshock_status}` – Connected / Offline / Error",
      "- `{openshock_last}` – last command (includes *by Name* when live)",
      "- `{openshock_intensity}` – last intensity",
      "- `{openshock_shocker}` – selected shocker",
      "- `{openshock_by}` – who triggered the last seen action (OpenShock live)",
      "",
      "### Safety",
      "All network work runs off the GUI thread."
    ]
  },
  "short_description": "OpenShock + PiShock control and status (live who on OpenShock)",
  "tags": ["openshock", "pishock", "shock", "estim", "control", "hardware"],
  "Github": "https://github.com/ArcticTechy/OSC-DreamChatbox-OpenShock",
  "main": "main.py",
  "enabled": false,
  "api": 2,
  "min_app": "v1.3.2",
  "is_linux": true,
  "is_windows": true,
  "template": "{openshock}",
  "layout": ["settings", "chatbox"],
  "chatbox": {
    "enabled": true,
    "user_editable": true
  },
  "placeholders": {
    "status": "connection state",
    "last": "last control command",
    "intensity": "intensity of the last command",
    "shocker": "selected shocker name or short ID",
    "by": "who triggered the last action (OpenShock live)"
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "label",
      "label": "Shocker",
      "default": "Pick a backend below. Network calls never block the UI."
    },
    {
      "key": "backend",
      "type": "choice",
      "label": "Backend",
      "default": "openshock",
      "choices": [
        {"value": "openshock", "label": "OpenShock (openshock.app)"},
        {"value": "pishock", "label": "PiShock (pishock.com)"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "g_openshock",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "OpenShock",
      "open": true,
      "items": [
        {
          "key": "os_token",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "API Token",
          "default": "",
          "secret": true,
          "hint": "Open-Shock-Token from openshock.app → Settings → API Tokens"
        },
        {
          "key": "os_base_url",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "API Base URL",
          "default": "https://api.openshock.app",
          "hint": "Change only if you self-host. No trailing slash."
        },
        {
          "key": "os_user_agent",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "User-Agent",
          "default": "OSC-DreamChatbox-Shocker/2.0",
          "hint": "OpenShock requires a non-empty User-Agent."
        },
        {
          "key": "os_shocker_id",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Shocker ID (UUID)",
          "default": "",
          "hint": "Paste a UUID or pick one after Refresh."
        },
        {
          "key": "os_watch_logs",
          "type": "bool",
          "label": "Watch live logs (show who)",
          "default": true,
          "hint": "Poll OpenShock logs so website / other apps actions appear in the chatbox with the username."
        },
        {
          "key": "os_poll_secs",
          "type": "int",
          "label": "Log poll interval",
          "default": 6,
          "min": 3,
          "max": 60,
          "suffix": " s",
          "hint": "How often to check for new remote actions when watching logs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "g_pishock",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "PiShock",
      "open": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "key": "ps_username",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Username",
          "default": "",
          "hint": "Your pishock.com username"
        },
        {
          "key": "ps_apikey",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "API Key",
          "default": "",
          "secret": true,
          "hint": "From pishock.com → Account"
        },
        {
          "key": "ps_sharecode",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Share Code",
          "default": "",
          "hint": "From the control page → Share button"
        },
        {
          "key": "ps_log_name",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Log name",
          "default": "OSC-DreamChatbox",
          "hint": "Shown in PiShock website logs as the source of the command"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "g_common",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Defaults & status",
      "open": true,
      "items": [
        {
          "key": "status_label",
          "type": "label",
          "label": "Status",
          "default": "not configured"
        },
        {
          "key": "btn_refresh",
          "type": "action",
          "label": "Refresh",
          "button": "Refresh",
          "style": "accent",
          "hint": "OpenShock: fetch shockers. PiShock: verify credentials."
        },
        {
          "key": "intensity",
          "type": "slider",
          "label": "Intensity",
          "default": 30,
          "min": 1,
          "max": 100,
          "suffix": " %"
        },
        {
          "key": "duration_ms",
          "type": "int",
          "label": "Duration (OpenShock)",
          "default": 1000,
          "min": 300,
          "max": 30000,
          "suffix": " ms",
          "hint": "Used for OpenShock. PiShock uses seconds below."
        },
        {
          "key": "duration_sec",
          "type": "int",
          "label": "Duration (PiShock)",
          "default": 1,
          "min": 1,
          "max": 15,
          "suffix": " s",
          "hint": "PiShock API uses whole seconds 1–15."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "g_actions",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Actions",
      "open": true,
      "items": [
        {
          "key": "btn_vibrate",
          "type": "action",
          "label": "Vibrate",
          "button": "Vibrate",
          "style": "accent"
        },
        {
          "key": "btn_shock",
          "type": "action",
          "label": "Shock",
          "button": "Shock",
          "style": "danger"
        },
        {
          "key": "btn_sound",
          "type": "action",
          "label": "Sound / Beep",
          "button": "Sound"
        },
        {
          "key": "btn_stop",
          "type": "action",
          "label": "Stop (OpenShock)",
          "button": "Stop",
          "hint": "OpenShock only. PiShock has no stop via the classic HTTP API."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "g_chatbox",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Chatbox line",
      "open": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "key": "show_when_offline",
          "type": "bool",
          "label": "Show line even when offline",
          "default": false
        },
        {
          "key": "prefix",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Prefix",
          "default": "⚡",
          "hint": "Shown in front of the status text."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
